IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FLIGHTLLM.

DATA DIVISION.
01 SYSTOLIC-ARRAYS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 CLOCK-FREQ-MHZ      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 ENERGY-EFF-X10      PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 LATENCY-US          PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FLIGHTLLM.
    IF SYSTOLIC-ARRAYS == 0 OR CLOCK-FREQ-MHZ == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 425 TO ENERGY-EFF-X10.
    MOVE 12 TO LATENCY-US.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 SYSTOLIC-ARRAYS.
    WEIGHT 30 LATENCY-US.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
